@startuml
autonumber

actor Patient
boundary "Patient Interface" as UI
control "Booking Service" as Booking
database "Application Database" as DB

Patient -> UI: Select a time slot and submit booking
UI -> Booking: bookAppointment(patientId, slotId)
Booking -> DB: Check slot availability
DB --> Booking: Available / unavailable

alt Slot is available
  Booking -> DB: Create appointment and reserve slot
  note right of DB
  Reservation must be atomic so
  concurrent requests cannot book
  the same slot.
  end note
  DB --> Booking: Saved appointment / save error
  alt Save succeeded
    Booking --> UI: Booking confirmation and status
    UI --> Patient: Display confirmed appointment
  else Save failed
    Booking --> UI: Booking error
    UI --> Patient: Display failure; no confirmation
  end
else Slot is unavailable
  Booking --> UI: Slot unavailable
  UI --> Patient: Ask patient to select another slot
end
@enduml
